{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33406","headline":"咏铁马鞭 · 李昌符","name":"咏铁马鞭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉将临流得铁鞭，鄂侯名字旧雕镌。\n须爲圣代无双物，肯逐将军卧九泉。\n汗马不侵诛虏血，神功今见补亡篇。\n时来终荐明君用，莫叹沉埋二百年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李昌符","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33406.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33406","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}